<title>SINGAPORE: Jacks Int 1st-half net rises 40 pct.</title>
<headline>Jacks Int 1st-half net rises 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.90  vs   0.64</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    3.00  vs   2.14</p>
<p>    Turnover			     125.53  vs 100.64</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     2.65  vs   2.19</p>
<p>    Interest income			0.13  vs   0.16</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   1.01  vs   0.90</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1.77  vs   1.44</p>
<p>    Tax					0.60  vs   0.56</p>
<p>    Minorities (expense)		 0.27  vs   0.24</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			 nil  vs   0.56 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Jacks International Ltd is a diversified industrial and technical trading company with subsidiaries in several countries including in Britain, Hong Kong and Australia.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
